@server = http://localhost:4004

### Controller: should see 4 budgets
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/Budgets
Authorization: Basic controller:
###
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/api-journalentryitembasic-srv/A_JournalEntryItemBasic
Authorization: Basic controller:

### Camille: should see Marketing and IT
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/Budgets
Authorization: Basic camille:

### Lucas: should see Maintenance and Production
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/Budgets
Authorization: Basic lucas:






### Sync actuals 2026 (controller only)
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/syncActuals
Authorization: Basic controller:
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fiscalYear": "2026" }

### Same call as Camille: should be refused (403)
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/syncActuals
Authorization: Basic camille:
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fiscalYear": "2026" }

### Budgets after sync
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/Budgets?$select=costCenterName,actualAmount,consumption,alertText
Authorization: Basic controller:








@marketing = 6f1a2b3c-0001-4000-8000-000000000001
@it        = 6f1a2b3c-0004-4000-8000-000000000004

### 1. Camille justifies Marketing (overrun) → 200, status J
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/Budgets({{marketing}})/BudgetCockpitService.justify
Authorization: Basic camille:
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Unplanned trade fair in Lyon, approved by the sales director" }

### 2. Lucas tries to justify Marketing (not his) → refused
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/Budgets({{marketing}})/BudgetCockpitService.justify
Authorization: Basic lucas:
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "test" }

### 3. Camille tries to justify IT (within budget) → 400
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/Budgets({{it}})/BudgetCockpitService.justify
Authorization: Basic camille:
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "test" }

### 4. Camille tries to validate → 403 (controller only)
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/Budgets({{marketing}})/BudgetCockpitService.validate
Authorization: Basic camille:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. Controller validates Marketing → 200, status V
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/budget-cockpit/Budgets({{marketing}})/BudgetCockpitService.validate
Authorization: Basic controller:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

